     "description": "* WHAT...Northeast winds 20 to 25 mph with frequent gusts up to 40\nmph expected for metro and coastal areas of Miami-Dade, Broward,\nand Palm Beach counties.\n\n* WHERE...Coastal Broward, Coastal Miami Dade, Coastal Palm Beach,\nMetro Broward, Metro Palm Beach, and Metropolitan Miami Dade\nCounties.\n\n* WHEN...From 11 AM this morning to 8 PM EDT Tuesday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree\nlimbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.",
